WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.795
I am a coward.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:07.632
How can I abandon someone

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.009
who is about to die?

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:14.139
I can download you
into my memory archives,

00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:16.766
and we can operate in a joined mode.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.648
-I'll navigate.
-Do you want me to follow an amateur?

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.942
We are approaching a level one storm.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:32.574
We need to go down.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:33.491
Down?

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.410
It's a guess, but yes.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:41.833
Jump across the next crevice!

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:47.547
The storm is behind me.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.967
Estimated level three!
The body will stand. Let's go!

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.177
Don't be ridiculous!

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:55.180
The Orichalt ore is straight ahead!
Come on!

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.848
You have some guts!

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.561
Dead end?!

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.980
The only thing you're good at
is giving orders!

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.996
This is...

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.874
the size, the sparkle...

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:27.003
I've never seen an Orichalt like this.

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:29.714
How much time is left
before the storm hits?

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:32.008
Probably two to three minutes.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.551
I'll get it.

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:36.513
What?!

00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:38.890
Something is interfering
with the consciousness signal.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.642
My archives are--

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:44.020
What?

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:46.606
What is that?

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.484
What?

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:13.925
Here it comes!

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:15.760
Rick, leave!

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.762
The biggest storm is approaching!

00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:19.764
How can we leave Ido and Maya?

00:02:19.764 --> 00:02:21.599
You will get hit, too!

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:23.518
Damn!

00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:39.284
Come on, come on!

00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:43.288
Ido, this is crazy!

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:45.039
What are you talking about?

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.041
It was your idea from the start.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:49.127
This is completely different!

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:51.129
This is too much!

00:02:52.922 --> 00:02:53.882
Hey, you.

00:02:53.965 --> 00:02:54.883
Yes, sir?

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.801
Did you say your name was Maya?

00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:58.178
You did well.

00:02:58.636 --> 00:03:00.805
You-- You are welcome.

